.SH NAME
QGDict \- Internal class for implementing QDict template classes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qgdict.h>\fR
.PP
Inherits QCollection.
.PP
Inherited by QAsciiDict, QDict, QIntDict and QPtrDict.
.PP
